OL,3,ABurnham refuses to rule out tax rises
OL,4,Ain autumn Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has refused to rule out
OL,7,Ftax rises in the upcoming autumn
OL,8,FBudget, saying he "won't be
OL,9,Funrealistic" about the "challenging"
OL,10,Fstate of public finances.
OL,12,FThe prime minister said he would take a
OL,13,F"careful approach" to the economy, and
OL,14,Fdefended his previously announced cost
OL,15,Fof living pledges as funded spending
OL,16,Fcommitments.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
