OL,3,AFrench tourist dies in Death Valley
OL,4,Aafter car gets stuck in mud
OL,5,
OL,6,FA French tourist has died in
OL,7,FCalifornia's Death Valley after
OL,8,Fbecoming stranded on the side of the
OL,9,Froad during 46.6C (116F) heat.
OL,11,FPolice found 68-year-old Pierre Michel
OL,12,FFormosa recently following a brief
OL,13,Fsearch, with the National Park service
OL,14,Fsaying he died while trying to seek
OL,15,Fhelp in the blistering heat when his
OL,16,Fcar got stuck in mud.
OL,18,F"This is a heartbreaking reminder of
OL,19,Fhow quickly conditions here can turn
OL,20,Fdangerous," Death Valley National Park
OL,21,FSuperintendent Mike Reynolds said in a
OL,22,Fstatement.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
